#: ../../li3po4/large-structure-rdf.rst:4
msgid "大規模構造とRDF"
msgstr "Large Structures and RDFs"

#: ../../li3po4/large-structure-rdf.rst:6
msgid ""
"モデルを大きくすると、溶融・急冷後の原子対の距離分布はどう変わるでしょうか。\\ "
"CHGNetで作った503、1006、2012原子のモデルでは部分RDFの曲線がおおむね一致し、125原子モデルではLi–PやP–Pのピークの形に違いが見られました。\\"
" P–Oの第一ピークは、どのモデルでも約1.5 Åに現れました。"
msgstr ""
"How does the distribution of distances between atom pairs after melting "
"and quenching change with model size? \\ The partial RDF curves largely "
"agreed for the CHGNet models with 503, 1006, and 2012 atoms, whereas the "
"125-atom model showed different peak shapes for pairs such as Li–P and "
"P–P. \\ The first P–O peak occurred at about 1.5 Å in every model."

#: ../../li3po4/large-structure-rdf.rst:15
msgid "構造と局所配位"
msgstr "Structure and Local Coordination"

#: ../../li3po4/large-structure-rdf.rst:17
msgid ""
"QuloudのGPU上でCHGNetによる分子動力学を実行し、125、503、1006、2012原子の構造を\\ `溶融・急冷 <https"
"://technical-notes.quemix.com/md/heating_simulation.html#melt-"
"quench>`__\\ で作りました。\\ :numref:`li3po4-large-structures` "
"に、溶融・急冷後の各セルの原子配置を示します。"
msgstr ""
"We ran CHGNet molecular dynamics on a GPU in Quloud and prepared "
"structures with 125, 503, 1006, and 2012 atoms by \\ `melting and "
"quenching <https://technical-notes.quemix.com/md/heating_simulation.html"
"#melt-quench>`__\\ . \\ :numref:`li3po4-large-structures` shows the "
"atomic arrangement in each cell after melting and quenching."

#: ../../li3po4/large-structure-rdf.rst:22
msgid "溶融・急冷した125、503、1006、2012原子のセルと、酸素を共有するPO₄四面体"
msgstr ""
"Cells with 125, 503, 1006, and 2012 atoms after melting and quenching, "
"with PO₄ tetrahedra sharing an oxygen atom"

#: ../../li3po4/large-structure-rdf.rst:27
msgid ""
"CHGNetによる溶融・急冷後の構造。上段左から125、503原子、下段左から1006、2012原子。\\ "
"各セルの右に、酸素を共有してつながるPO₄四面体の例を示します。"
msgstr ""
"Structures after melting and quenching with CHGNet. From left to right, "
"the top row shows the 125- and 503-atom models, and the bottom row shows "
"the 1006- and 2012-atom models. \\ To the right of each cell are examples"
" of PO₄ tetrahedra connected by shared oxygen atoms."

#: ../../li3po4/large-structure-rdf.rst:30
msgid ""
":numref:`li3po4-rdf-large-models` では、300 KのMD軌跡から求めた部分RDFを比べます。\\ "
"503、1006、2012原子モデルでは、6種類の部分RDFはおおむね同じ形です。\\ 125原子モデルでは、約3 ÅのLi–Pのピークと2 "
"Å弱のLi–Oの第一ピークが、ほかのモデルより高くなります。P–Pにも4～5.5 Åに複数の山が見られます。\\ 約1.5 "
"Åの鋭いP–Oの第一ピークは、4つのモデルに共通するリン酸四面体内の結合距離に対応します。"
msgstr ""
":numref:`li3po4-rdf-large-models` compares partial RDFs from the MD "
"trajectories at 300 K. \\ The six partial RDFs have broadly similar "
"shapes in the 503-, 1006-, and 2012-atom models. \\ In the 125-atom "
"model, the Li–P peak at about 3 Å and the first Li–O peak just below 2 Å "
"are higher than in the other models. The P–P RDF also shows several peaks"
" at 4–5.5 Å. \\ The sharp first P–O peak at about 1.5 Å corresponds to "
"the bond length within the phosphate tetrahedra in all four models."

#: ../../li3po4/large-structure-rdf.rst:37
msgid "4つのモデルの部分RDF。約1.5 ÅのP–Oピークは共通し、125原子モデルのLi–PとLi–Oのピークが高い"
msgstr ""
"Partial RDFs for four models. All share a P–O peak near 1.5 Å, and the "
"125-atom model has higher Li–P and Li–O peaks."

#: ../../li3po4/large-structure-rdf.rst:42
msgid ""
"Li–Li、Li–P、Li–O、P–P、P–O、O–Oの部分RDF（300 Kの5 psの軌跡で平均）。\\ "
"左上から縦に125、503原子、右上から縦に1006、2012原子のモデル。横軸は原子対の距離（Å）です。"
msgstr ""
"Partial RDFs for Li–Li, Li–P, Li–O, P–P, P–O, and O–O, averaged over a 5 "
"ps trajectory at 300 K. \\ From top to bottom, the left column shows the "
"125- and 503-atom models and the right column shows the 1006- and "
"2012-atom models. The horizontal axis gives the distance between atoms in"
" each pair (Å)."

#: ../../li3po4/large-structure-rdf.rst:46
msgid "文献との比較"
msgstr "Comparison with the Literature"

#: ../../li3po4/large-structure-rdf.rst:48
msgid "本計算の組成から求めたLi/P比は、125原子モデルで2.875、ほかの3つで約2.906です。文献が模した薄膜の実測値（約2.9）に近く、125、503、1006原子モデルは文献と組成・原子数がそろっています。溶融・急冷の履歴もそろっているかは確認が必要です。"
msgstr ""
"The Li/P ratios calculated from the compositions in this work are 2.875 "
"for the 125-atom model and about 2.906 for the other three. These are "
"close to the measured ratio (about 2.9) of the thin film modeled by Li et"
" al. The 125-, 503-, and 1006-atom models match those of Li et al. in "
"composition and atom count. We still need to check whether the melt-"
"quench histories match."

#: ../../li3po4/large-structure-rdf.rst:50
msgid ""
"文献では、125原子モデルに部分的な結晶秩序が残り、503、1006原子モデルでは結晶的な並びが見られなくなりました。\\ "
"また、2つのPO₄四面体が酸素を1個共有するP₂O₇二量体を見いだし、薄膜の赤外分光の結果と整合することを報告しています。 "
"`Liらの図10とその解説 <https://doi.org/10.1063/1.4997242>`__"
msgstr ""
"Li et al. found that some crystalline order remained in the 125-atom "
"model, whereas no crystalline arrangement was observed in the 503- or "
"1006-atom models. \\ They also identified P₂O₇ dimers, in which two PO₄ "
"tetrahedra share one oxygen atom, and reported that this finding was "
"consistent with the thin-film infrared spectroscopy results. `Li et al., "
"Fig. 10 and the accompanying discussion "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/1.4997242>`__"

#: ../../li3po4/large-structure-rdf.rst:53
msgid "本計算でも125原子モデルだけ部分RDFがほかと異なり、文献で125原子モデルにだけ結晶秩序が残ったことと同じ傾向です。ただし、結晶秩序が残ったかどうかは部分RDFだけでは判断できず、原子の配列を定量的に調べる必要があります。"
msgstr ""
"In this work, too, only the 125-atom model had partial RDFs that differed"
" from the rest, consistent with the trend reported by Li et al., who "
"observed residual crystalline order only in the 125-atom model. However, "
"partial RDFs alone cannot establish whether crystalline order remained. "
"That requires quantitative analysis of the atomic arrangement."

#: ../../li3po4/large-structure-rdf.rst:56
msgid "まとめ"
msgstr "Summary"

#: ../../li3po4/large-structure-rdf.rst:58
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"503原子以上の3つのモデルで部分RDFがおおむね一致し、P–Oの第一ピークは125原子モデルも含めて約1.5 Åに現れました。\\ "
"セルサイズに対して構造の特徴が収束したか、実験試料とどこまで対応するかを評価するには、RDFと構造図に加えて、結晶秩序や\\ `四面体の連結性 "
"<https://technical-notes.quemix.com/md/rdf.html#polyhedral-"
"connectivity>`__\\ を定量化し、P₂O₇二量体の割合などを調べる必要があります。 \\ :numref:`{number}. "
"{name} <li3po4-doc-large-model-diffusivity>` では、1006原子モデルでLiの拡散を調べます。"
msgstr ""
"The partial RDFs largely agreed for the three models with 503 atoms or "
"more, and the first P–O peak appeared near 1.5 Å in all four models, "
"including the 125-atom model. \\ To assess whether the structural "
"features have converged with cell size and how closely the models "
"represent the experimental samples, we need more than the RDFs and "
"structural images. We need to quantify crystalline order and \\ "
"`connectivity of the tetrahedra <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/md/rdf.html#polyhedral-connectivity>`__ \\ and examine "
"quantities such as the fraction of P₂O₇ dimers. \\ :numref:`{number}. "
"{name} <li3po4-doc-large-model-diffusivity>` examines Li diffusion in the"
" 1006-atom model."

